    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>A plugin that replaces the old Saudi Riyal symbol with the new one on WooCommerce sites.</p>\n<p>اضافة ووردبريس تقوم باستبدال رمز عملة الريال السعودي ر.س بالرمز الجديد الذي تم اطلاقه من قبل البنك المركزي السعودي.<br />\nلمزيد من التفاصيل، يرجى مراجعة <a href=\"https://www.sama.gov.sa/en-US/Currency/SRS/Pages/default.aspx\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">إعلان البنك المركزي السعودي</a>.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed currency symbol display in RTL emails.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix sale price currency symbol in blocks based themes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed an issue where the currency symbol didn&#8217;t update correctly when changing product quantities in Cart/Checkout blocks.</li>\n<li>Fix currency symbol in WooCommerce emails.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>For using &#8220;left with space&#8221; currency position.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix replacing the symbol within the admin dashboard.</li>\n<li>Declare WooCommerce features compatibility to hide warnings.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
